              "json": "## Azure Advisor and Resource Health\r\n\r\nAdvisor recommendations honor all three global filters. An empty Advisor result\r\nmeans no matching visible recommendations, not proof of compliance or health.\r\n\r\nThe fleet health grid shows only the availability records indexed by Resource Graph;\r\ncoverage for Function Apps can be incomplete. Use the **selected-app Resource Health**\r\nview below for the live ARM status. Coverage also depends on the hosting plan:\r\nConsumption can return **Unknown** with an explanation. Missing or unavailable\r\ncoverage is not a healthy result."
